Triune licensing
================

Triune combines code under different licenses. These are cumulative where a
file contains both inherited code and new Triune changes, not a choice between
two licenses for the same contribution.

* Inherited Omnigent code and the custom baseline at commit
  4646d0bbd9492eed3bff0e95d39f8ac85d1b1eb8 retain Apache License 2.0 and their
  applicable third-party terms. Full Apache text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
* New copyrightable Triune additions and modifications made after that baseline,
  to the extent owned and licensable by MrStrenggeheim, use the unmodified
  PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0. Full text:
  LICENSES/PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.txt.
* Existing third-party notices, individual license declarations and prior grants
  continue to apply. No previously granted Apache permission is revoked.

Required Notice: Copyright 2026 MrStrenggeheim. Triune (https://github.com/MrStrenggeheim/triune).

Read LICENSING.md for source boundaries, attribution and permitted use.
